# Architecture

- **RSC default.** `"use client"` only at the smallest leaf (motion, Three, browser APIs, stateful tools).
- **Pages compose sections.** No large logic or timelines in `page.tsx`.
- **Sections** (`components/sections/*`) own layout + copy composition.
- **Animations** (`components/animations/*`) own GSAP/R3F/Framer islands.
- **`next/dynamic` + `ssr: false`** only inside Client Components — never in Server Components.
- **One Lenis** in providers; sync ScrollTrigger when both run.
- **MDX** in `content/`; binaries in `public/`; GLSL in `/shaders` or colocated.
- Keep `src/app` App Router — do not flatten to a non-Next folder fantasy.
- Before non-obvious work: 1–3 sentences on **why**, then implement.
